J1 nV 0 nJ1s off Jmod
Q1 nV nJ1s nE Qmod
Q2 nV nJ1s nE2 off Qmod
Z1 nV 0 nJ1s off Zmod
O1 nV 0 {nJ1s} {0} Omod
Y1 nV 0 {nJ1s} {0} Ymod
